Z||000006||87GT||07-06-99||06:43 AM||||When I set out to be a Fiero.  I was told to only look for 87/88 model year fieros.  So, the only one I could get a hold of was a 87GT.  Which is what I wanted.(a GT)  My brakes are awesome.  They are better than the ones my Grand Prix had.  As far as suspensions go, I am still waiting to hear on the WS6 vs. Lotus differences.  I think its lotus.
